{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watermelon (with a broken head) Game is a thrilling and exhilarating physics-based puzzle game inspired by polyomino puzzles and the Suika Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/1.\uce90\uc2a4\ucf00\uc774\ub529.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game follows the journey of a head-injured watermelon as it seeks to recover its lost emotions. Each block represents an emotion, and merging identical blocks evolves them into the next stage of emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategically Drop Blocks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud50c\ub9bd\ud68c\uc804\uac78\uae30.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can rotate and flip blocks to strategically drop them into the desired position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\uc544\uc2ac\uc544\uc2ac\uc313\uae302.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although the space is limited, the blocks are made up of straight lines and right angles, allowing you to interlock them, balance, and stack them as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rotate the Watermelon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud68c\uc804\ud574\uc11c_\ube14\ub85d_\uc6c0\uc9c1\uc774\uae30.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can rotate the watermelon to move the blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ube48\ud2c8\ub9cc\ub4e4\uae30_1.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use this to create gaps between blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud754\ub4e4\uc5b4\uc11c_\uc11e\uae30.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also merge the blocks inside the watermelon (though it's not easy!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ubc1b\uc73c\ub824\ub2e4_\uc6d0\ub798\uac70\uae4c\uc9c0_\ub5a8\uc5b4\ud2b8\ub9ac\uae30.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, as you might accidentally drop more blocks out of the container if you're not careful!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Regaining All Emotions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540460/5b87edb8af1e3616deb7ebd6f83db2b08ec3ff7b.jpg"},{"name":"I'll fix you!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540460/2292c63ef88ad817d168cde430f5f3906fe12ce0.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540460?t=1744098218","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/b4fe7b7f1cd08cb066d76454f6a53207b4ab39dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744098218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/5c8953a0a700b248898e5dc5b7cd136ab83fa0a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744098218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/5c8953a0a700b248898e5dc5b7cd136ab83fa0a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744098218","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watermelon (with a broken head) Game is a thrilling and exhilarating physics-based puzzle game inspired by polyomino puzzles and the Suika Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/1.\uce90\uc2a4\ucf00\uc774\ub529.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game follows the journey of a head-injured watermelon as it seeks to recover its lost emotions. Each block represents an emotion, and merging identical blocks evolves them into the next stage of emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategically Drop Blocks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud50c\ub9bd\ud68c\uc804\uac78\uae30.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can rotate and flip blocks to strategically drop them into the desired position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\uc544\uc2ac\uc544\uc2ac\uc313\uae302.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although the space is limited, the blocks are made up of straight lines and right angles, allowing you to interlock them, balance, and stack them as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rotate the Watermelon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud68c\uc804\ud574\uc11c_\ube14\ub85d_\uc6c0\uc9c1\uc774\uae30.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can rotate the watermelon to move the blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ube48\ud2c8\ub9cc\ub4e4\uae30_1.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use this to create gaps between blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud754\ub4e4\uc5b4\uc11c_\uc11e\uae30.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also merge the blocks inside the watermelon (though it's not easy!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ubc1b\uc73c\ub824\ub2e4_\uc6d0\ub798\uac70\uae4c\uc9c0_\ub5a8\uc5b4\ud2b8\ub9ac\uae30.gif?t=1744098218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, as you might accidentally drop more blocks out of the container if you're not careful!</p>","developers":["10001 & caku"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/2f7a98b541548652d1a4952b65413a7b0bbd635e/header.jpg?t=1744098218","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108225,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108225/movie480.mp4?t=1742808965","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108225/movie_max.mp4?t=1742808965"},"name":"main trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108225/14a0ac8c19118a5581f031